{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昂船洲有船隻起火。今日（17日）早上約9時52分，昂船洲昂運路對開，有一艘已泊岸的躉船發生火警；消防員動用兩條喉及兩隊煙帽隊撲救，早上11時18分大致將火救熄，射水降溫。事件中，15人需要疏散，暫無受傷報告。</p><p>消防處呼籲，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請盡量留在室內及關閉門窗，並保持鎮定。</p><figure><img alt=\"昂船洲今早（17日）有躉船起火，冒出濃煙，消防撲救。（香港消防處 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188089474190413824715289.jpeg/PqK0t3bKlqsoQ7EkPFunUQkAZjw_lhpcSXpTL0l6Uy8\"/><figcaption>昂船洲今早（17日）有躉船起火，冒出濃煙，消防撲救。（香港消防處 Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"昂船洲今早（17日）有躉船起火，冒出濃煙，消防撲救。（香港消防處 Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188089476606464000147382.jpeg/lIwH8ilFLazYFnJK0nvj2HhVaGOxqQa2yBkoa8gZKGs\"/><figcaption>昂船洲今早（17日）有躉船起火，冒出濃煙，消防撲救。（香港消防處 Facebook）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T03:39:08.514724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:31:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:37:33.270618+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:37:33.270618+00:00","content_hash":"7f78594541cc3762cd805d9139912f2f03b57414a3ba8050ba9f765be7964b2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}